msgid "Used for candidate previews; no images are automatically generated or fetched. PNG/JPEG/WebP up to 4 MiB, dimensions up to 2048 (4M pixels). Decoded images are resized to a maximum edge of 512 and re-encoded as PNG, removing metadata and trailing content. Stored separately; model updates and rollbacks do not change it."
msgstr "用于候选角色预览，不自动生成或抓取图片。PNG／JPEG／WebP 最多 4 MiB，宽高不超过 2048（最多 4M 像素）；解码后缩至最长边 512 并重编码 PNG，移除元数据与尾部内容。独立保存，不随模型更新或回退改变。"

